      <div type="clause" n="15a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 15a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hwá ðonne friðleasan man healde oððe feormie, bete swa hit lagu wǽs.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And therefore if anyone maintains or harbours an outlawed man, he shall make amends in accordance with the established law.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hwa þæne friðleasan man healde oððe flyman feormie, bete þæt, swa hit ær lagu wæs.</ab>
      </div>
